no changes; preserved -> ./dist/greeter.zpkg
cached: 2/2 files
# ANCHOR_END: build
# ANCHOR: run-artifact
$ z42 run dist/greeter.zpkg -- 小明
Hello, 小明!
# ANCHOR_END: run-artifact
